<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1474671265"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1529693632"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Say So -Japanese Version- (tofubeats Remix)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Rainych / tofubeats"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Say So -Japanese Version- (tofubeats Remix)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:45.024"><div begin="00:18.363" end="03:45.484"><p begin="00:18.363" end="00:22.351" itunes:key="L39065">夜朝までずっとそばにいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到夜尽天明 请一直陪在我身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru a sa ma de zu 't to so ba ni i te</span></p><p begin="00:22.361" end="00:26.416" itunes:key="L39066">合図をしたって言わないの?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算给你暗示 你也不愿说出口吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i zu wo shi ta 't te i wa na i no ？</span></p><p begin="00:26.968" end="00:30.992" itunes:key="L39067">全然気づかずもう方法はない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">完全毫无所觉 我已没有办法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n ze n ki du ka zu mo u ho u ho u ha na i</span></p><p begin="00:31.012" end="00:35.299" itunes:key="L39068">あたしが欲しいとそう言ってよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快点说你想要我啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta shi ga ho shi i to so u i 't te yo</span></p><p begin="00:35.668" end="00:39.650" itunes:key="L39069">夜朝までずっとそばにいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到夜尽天明 请一直陪在我身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru a sa ma de zu 't to so ba ni i te</span></p><p begin="00:39.660" end="00:43.721" itunes:key="L39070">合図をしたって言わないの?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算给你暗示 你也不愿说出口吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i zu wo shi ta 't te i wa na i no ？</span></p><p begin="00:44.298" end="00:48.280" itunes:key="L39071">全然気づかずもう方法はない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">完全毫无所觉 我已没有办法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n ze n ki du ka zu mo u ho u ho u ha na i</span></p><p begin="00:48.294" end="00:52.483" itunes:key="L39072">あたしが欲しいとそう言ってよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快点说你想要我啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta shi ga ho shi i to so u i 't te yo</span></p><p begin="00:52.569" end="00:57.252" itunes:key="L39073">いつから君が愛をせず<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知何时起 无法感受到你的爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka ra ki mi ga a i wo se zu</span></p><p begin="00:57.262" end="01:01.464" itunes:key="L39074">打ち明けられない君はどうした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你也从不挑明 究竟是怎么了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u chi a ke ra re na i ki mi ha do u shi ta</span></p><p begin="01:01.556" end="01:03.401" itunes:key="L39075">どうすればいいの?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我该怎么办？快告诉我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u su re ba i i no ？ o shi e te yo</span></p><p begin="01:03.411" end="01:05.651" itunes:key="L39076">教えてよ</p><p begin="01:05.661" end="01:07.602" itunes:key="L39077">隠し事見抜けた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">隐藏的心事被看穿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ku shi go to mi nu ke ta</span></p><p begin="01:07.612" end="01:09.884" itunes:key="L39078">辞めたいけどたまらない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要放弃却又无法放弃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya me ta i ke do ta ma ra na i</span></p><p begin="01:09.894" end="01:14.532" itunes:key="L39079">こう続けてもいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样继续下去也无妨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko u tsu du ke te mo i i</span></p><p begin="01:14.549" end="01:18.838" itunes:key="L39080">お互いに攻め合って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你相互发起攻势</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ta ga i ni se me a 't te</span></p><p begin="01:18.865" end="01:24.880" itunes:key="L39081">欲しいならほら叫べ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要的话就大声喊出来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho shi i na ra ho ra sa ke be</span></p><p begin="01:25.164" end="01:27.401" itunes:key="L39082">しないといけない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">否则就不行哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi na i to i ke na i</span></p><p begin="01:27.492" end="01:31.559" itunes:key="L39083">夜朝までずっとそばにいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到夜尽天明 请一直陪在我身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru a sa ma de zu 't to so ba ni i te</span></p><p begin="01:31.569" end="01:35.655" itunes:key="L39084">合図をしたって言わないの?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算给你暗示 你也不愿说出口吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i zu wo shi ta 't te i wa na i no ？</span></p><p begin="01:36.118" end="01:40.198" itunes:key="L39085">全然気づかずもう方法はない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">完全毫无所觉 我已没有办法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n ze n ki du ka zu mo u ho u ho u ha na i</span></p><p begin="01:40.208" end="01:44.802" itunes:key="L39086">あたしが欲しいとそう言ってよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快点说你想要我啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta shi ga ho shi i to so u i 't te yo</span></p><p begin="01:44.812" end="01:48.851" itunes:key="L39087">夜朝までずっとそばにいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到夜尽天明 请一直陪在我身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru a sa ma de zu 't to so ba ni i te</span></p><p begin="01:48.861" end="01:52.984" itunes:key="L39088">合図をしたって言わないの?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算给你暗示 你也不愿说出口吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i zu wo shi ta 't te i wa na i no ？</span></p><p begin="01:53.495" end="01:57.481" itunes:key="L39089">全然気づかずもう方法はない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">完全毫无所觉 我已没有办法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n ze n ki du ka zu mo u ho u ho u ha na i</span></p><p begin="01:57.491" end="02:01.801" itunes:key="L39090">あたしが欲しいとそう言ってよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快点说你想要我啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta shi ga ho shi i to so u i 't te yo</span></p><p begin="02:01.811" end="02:04.215" itunes:key="L39091">胸を張って息をのんで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抬头挺胸 屏住呼吸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ne wo ha 't te i ki wo no n de</span></p><p begin="02:04.316" end="02:06.401" itunes:key="L39111">見たことのない in a dress like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身着从未曾见过的盛装</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ta ko to no na i in a dress like this</span></p><p begin="02:06.411" end="02:08.305" itunes:key="L39112">こんなに素敵な人はいない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再没有如此美丽的人了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na ni su te ki na hi to ha na i</span></p><p begin="02:08.315" end="02:10.707" itunes:key="L39092">Prolly why 君は黙ったままlike zip<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想这就是你沉默得像嘴上拉了拉链的原因</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Prolly why ki mi ha da ma 't ta ma ma like zip</span></p><p begin="02:10.715" end="02:12.909" itunes:key="L39113">Like it, love it たまらん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喜欢 热爱 难以抑制</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Like it love it ta ma ra n</span></p><p begin="02:12.919" end="02:15.054" itunes:key="L39093">Take it, own it奪った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接受 占有 掠夺</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Take it own it u ba 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:15.064" end="02:16.940" itunes:key="L39094">Boy, stop playing 集中して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别再玩闹 集中精神</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Boy stop playing shu u chu u shi te</span></p><p begin="02:16.950" end="02:19.147" itunes:key="L39114">遠慮なんていらない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无需再有顾虑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e n ryo na n te i ra na i</span></p><p begin="02:19.366" end="02:21.503" itunes:key="L39095">Shut it, save it 進め<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闭嘴 省省吧 进攻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Shut it save it su su me</span></p><p begin="02:21.513" end="02:23.747" itunes:key="L39096">正直に言え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坦诚直言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u ji ki ni i e</span></p><p begin="02:23.757" end="02:27.772" itunes:key="L39097">Knowin' you want all this woman 味わってみて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道你只想要这个女人</span></p><p begin="02:28.066" end="02:30.201" itunes:key="L39098">周りが反対しても I have you with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算周围全都反对</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma wa ri ga ha n ta i shi te mo</span></p><p begin="02:30.211" end="02:32.349" itunes:key="L39115">友達がsayin' you mad committed<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">朋友说你疯了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to mo da chi ga sayin' you mad committed</span></p><p begin="02:32.359" end="02:34.556" itunes:key="L39116">Realer than anybody代わりがない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你比任何人都真实 无可替代</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Realer than anybody ka wa ri ga na i</span></p><p begin="02:34.558" end="02:36.758" itunes:key="L39099">All of the body-ody, 触れていい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你可以触碰我的整个身体</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">All of the body- ody fu re te i i</span></p><p begin="02:36.768" end="02:40.700" itunes:key="L39100">夜朝までずっとそばにいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到夜尽天明 请一直陪在我身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru a sa ma de zu 't to so ba ni i te</span></p><p begin="02:40.710" end="02:44.828" itunes:key="L39101">合図をしたって言わないの?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算给你暗示 你也不愿说出口吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i zu wo shi ta 't te i wa na i no ？</span></p><p begin="02:45.364" end="02:49.395" itunes:key="L39102">全然気づかずもう方法はない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">完全毫无所觉 我已没有办法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n ze n ki du ka zu mo u ho u ho u ha na i</span></p><p begin="02:49.405" end="02:54.000" itunes:key="L39103">あたしが欲しいとそう言ってよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快点说你想要我啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta shi ga ho shi i to so u i 't te yo</span></p><p begin="02:54.010" end="02:55.814" itunes:key="L39104">夜朝まで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使直到黎明 都在向你暗示</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru a sa ma de a i zu wo shi ta 't te</span></p><p begin="02:58.051" end="03:00.281" itunes:key="L39106">合図をしたって</p><p begin="03:02.664" end="03:04.607" itunes:key="L39107">全然気づかず<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也完全毫无所觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n ze n ki du ka zu</span></p><p begin="03:06.693" end="03:11.390" itunes:key="L39108">あたしが欲しいとそう言ってよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快点说你想要我啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta shi ga ho shi i to so u i 't te yo</span></p><p begin="03:29.111" end="03:37.316" itunes:key="L39109">夜朝までずっとそばにいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到夜尽天明 请一直陪在我身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru a sa ma de zu 't to so ba ni i te</span></p><p begin="03:37.801" end="03:45.484" itunes:key="L39110">合図をしたって言わないの?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算给你暗示 你也不愿说出口吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i zu wo shi ta 't te i wa na i no ？</span></p></div></body></tt>